 153+ 3854              ; carry set/A=status. Production DMA destination is physical 108000h on
 154+ 3854              ; page 42h, mapped into WIN3 through MPAGEX (#10) using Project125 selector encoding.
 155+ 3854              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
